++/**
++ * Extracts IOPlatformUUID from `ioreg -rd1 -c IOPlatformExpertDevice` output,
++ * e.g. `"IOPlatformUUID" = "D8F7807A-6B93-57A4-9DF2-E9A54FA2E046"`. Returns
