+ ## Important patterns
+ 
+@@ -172,20 +171,6 @@ Before commit/push/PR: use the **`pre-push-review`** skill (`~/.cursor/skills/pr
+ - **Permission modes**: `default`, `acceptEdits`, `auto`, `bypassPermissions`, `plan`
